<article class="env-proposition" id="34A086">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/34A086">Proposition <span data-tag="34A086">4.2.1.5</span>.</a> Let $\calC $ be an $\infty $-category, and let $p: X \rightarrow \calC $ be a diagram. Then the natural map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \calC _{p/} \rightarrow \calC ^{p/} \]
</div>
  <p> is an equivalence of $\infty $-categories. </p>
